                                "text": "After yet another check, there was once again a \"Deltic\" demonstration that no A4 would have been able to rival with a 340-ton load, speed being maintained unbrokenly at between 92 and 85 m.p.h. from Little Bytham up to Stoke Summit, where we were exactly 10min ahead of time."
